# The only things tracked here are the links to the sibling library projects (engine, asset,
# asset-tools); everything else (meson's promoted redirect wraps, .wraplock, extracted sources,
# packagecache) is a regenerable build artifact.
*
!.gitignore
!string-core
!string-asset
!string-asset-tools
!string-ui
!string-render-forward
!string-debug
!string-client
!string-scene

# Hand-authored wrap (not a meson-generated redirect): the JSON reader for `.scene.json`
# descriptors, which are parsed app-side. Tracked by name so it is not mistaken for an artifact.
!nlohmann_json.wrap
